/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T11:32:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T11:32:23Z","body":"> No idea why but the button order is reversed for me 😅\r\n\r\nIt is because it uses the display server get_swap_cancel_ok for button order.\r\nThis is how it looks before this PR too minus the checkbox on Mac, correct and what order would you expect here?\r\n\r\nI pushed a change so checkbox should always be on the left side now.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso the order on KDE feels a bit strange if you change editor setting for ok button order to cancel first:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1087\" height=\"189\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260718_103342\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08362a7b-b0f3-48b3-83b2-8ba156965c9b\" />\r\n\r\nThis could also be changed if we want\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAdded a spacer before the checkbox. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1054\" height=\"110\" alt=\"Screenshot_20260718_123521\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8f55549-bf09-4927-9814-ef43ef78a8a3\" />\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5033415960/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]